    <Description>Hello, this macros is made for finding signals in stalcraft with 90% success rate, resolution 1920x1080 u just need to bind your SAK1 key to X and macros key to Z bcs u unfortunatly have to open and close SAK by yourself, when the bulb starts blinking just press Z and it will start the macros and u just need to wait until its completion. You can also use second monitor to watch some videos so u dont go insane while waiting for signal to appear.</Description>
